Thanks a lot for the wonderful suggestion. I used it and worked pretty well. Now I need to have a single latent score for all the items, using the predicted score. So basically, I have 3 Items, say Item1, Item 2 and Item 3. At present, I am using the factor scores of Item 1 and Item 2 to predict the factor score of Item 3. But I also need a common factor score for all these 3 items together. I can have a model with all three items together, but my question is, if there is a way I can use the factor score of Item 1, Item 2 and Item 3 in the combined model somehow, to obtain the common factor score of all 3 items together. I highly appreciate your concern.

